@startuml
title MallBay 系统上下文图

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #0F3A5F
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFC
}
skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #0F3A5F
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FB
}

actor "店长 / 管理员" as Manager
actor "销售" as Sales
actor "采购" as Purchasing
actor "施工主管 / 施工人员" as Construction
actor "客服 / 售后" as Service
actor "财务" as Finance
actor "审核员" as Auditor

rectangle "MallBay Web\nNext.js + React + Ant Design" as Web
rectangle "MallBay API\nNestJS Modular Monolith" as Api
database "PostgreSQL\nPrisma schema" as Db
queue "Redis\n缓存 / 预留队列能力" as Redis
cloud "对象存储\n施工/质保/售后照片" as Oss
rectangle "导出文件\nExcel / 报表" as Export

Manager --> Web : 门店运营、成员、设置
Sales --> Web : 客户、订单、收款
Purchasing --> Web : 采购需求、采购订单、到货验收
Construction --> Web : 排班、派工、施工记录
Service --> Web : 质保、售后、客户跟进
Finance --> Web : 财务、发票、返利
Auditor --> Web : 门店审核、后台管理

Web --> Api : REST JSON\nBearer Token
Api --> Db : Prisma Client
Api --> Redis : 连接预置
Api --> Oss : 上传/读取图片
Web --> Export : 前端导出 Excel

note right of Api
当前是模块化单体，
不是微服务架构。
end note

@enduml
